    "title": "KZ S1 S1D TWS True Wireless Bluetooth 5.0 Earphones Dynamic/Hybrid Earbuds Touch Control Noise Cancelling Sport Headset",
    "body_html": "<div class=\"detailmodule_dynamic\"><widget data-widget-type=\"customText\" id=\"24203753\" title=\"\" type=\"custom\"></widget></div>\n<div class=\"detailmodule_html\"><div class=\"detail-desc-decorate-richtext\">\n<div><strong style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(192, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">If the headset cannot be charged:\u00a0</span></span> please check whether the film on the two sides of the headphones is torn off, please remove the film and try charging again.</strong></div>\n<div><img alt=\"33\" src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/H7156acea6ac5476a8b5511a6a365b40cQ.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><strong style=\"font-size: 22px; color: rgb(192, 0, 0);\">Note:</strong></div>\n<div>\n<span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><strong>Please\u00a0know\u00a0the\u00a0version\u00a0information\u00a0before\u00a0ordering\uff1a<br>S1D\u00a0is\u00a0Dynamic\u00a0verison\u00a0(1DD),White\u00a0and\u00a0Black ,Not Support Game Mode.<br>S1\u00a0is\u00a0Hybrid\u00a0technology\u00a0verison\u00a0(1DD+1BA),Gray\u00a0and\u00a0green,Support Game Mode.</strong><br><span id=\"kse-bm-28S\" style=\"display: none;\">\u00a0</span><span style=\"display: none;\">\u00a0</span><strong>2 versions of packaging is different .<span id=\"kse-bm-28E\" style=\"display: none;\">\u00a0</span></strong></span></span> <span style=\"display: none;\">\u00a0</span>\n</div>\n<div>\u00a0</div>\n<div><strong style=\"color: rgb(247, 150, 70); font-size: 16px;\">True wireless hybrid technology bluetooth headset</strong></div>\n<div>\u00a0</div>\n<div><strong style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Product specifications:</strong></div>\n<div>\u00a0</div>\n<div><strong style=\"color: rgb(247, 150, 70); font-size: 13.3333px;\">Bluetooth version :V5.0</strong></div>\n<p style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(247, 150, 70);\"><strong>Bluetooth Range : about\u00a020m</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(247, 150, 70);\"><strong>Headset battery capacity:40mA</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(247, 150, 70);\"><strong>Battery capacity of charging compartment : 300mA</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(247, 150, 70);\"><strong>Headset operation time :\u00a0\u2248 3H</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(247, 150, 70);\"><strong>Standby time of charging compartment :\u00a0\u2265 100h</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(247, 150, 70);\"><strong>Headset weight :10g</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(247, 150, 70);\"><strong>Charging compartment weight :45g</strong></span></p>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">KZ-S1\u00a0</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Performance innovation, comprehensive upgrade</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">AAC Advanced Audio Transmission \u4e28 HIFI Sound Quality</span></div>\n<div>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"></span> <span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">No sense delay game mode \u4e28 Bluetooth 5.0</span>\n</div>\n<p style=\"\"><img alt=\"S1-S1D\u8be6\u60c5\u66f4\u6539\u82f1_01\" src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/Hb4a740f9fade4183b305cfa4bad1ba4cV.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>\n<p>Advanced audio coding transmission technology</p>\n<p>Professional audio quality comes from the dual protection of chip's blessing and AAC's advanced coding ability. AAC advanced audio coding and transmission technology is adopted to greatly improve the listening quality and bring natural and clear sound.</p>\n<p style=\"\"><img alt=\"S1-S1D\u8be6\u60c5\u66f4\u6539\u82f1_02\" src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/H0f962cd6debd43af9811209352022c8aI.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>\n<p>With the unique\u00a0coding technology of AAC, the music signal has the following advantages in the transmission process</p>\n<p>File smaller</p>\n<p>Fast\u00a0<span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">transmission\u00a0</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Better qualirt\u00a0</span></p>\n<div>*Mainstream\u00a0Android\u00a0and\u00a0apple\u00a0mobile\u00a0phones\u00a0support\u00a0AAC\u00a0transmission\u00a0mode,\u00a0but\u00a0a\u00a0few\u00a0old\u00a0Android\u00a0devices\u00a0cannot\u00a0support\u00a0it.\u00a0</div>\n<p style=\"\"><img alt=\"S1-S1D\u8be6\u60c5\u66f4\u6539\u82f1_03\" src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/H0ff6110e1eda404294aaab0043b54b32X.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>\n<p>Customized \"small steel gun\" dynamic unit</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(247, 150, 70);\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>KZ-S1D</strong></span></span></p>\n<p>Equipped with a \"small steel gun\" dynamic unit, you can feel the surging power and wide sound range to bring more infectious sound</p>\n<p style=\"\"><img alt=\"S1-S1D\u8be6\u60c5\u66f4\u6539\u82f1_04\" src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/H75b917c817cd41c2afc49df30464ab52e.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>\n<p>30095 High frequency balanced armature\u00a0unit</p>\n<p>The independent high-frequency balanced armature unit ,making the voice richer and clearer, interpreting the true timbre of different vocal instruments.</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(247, 150, 70);\">KZ-S1</span></strong></span></p>\n<p>Dynamic + high frequency balanced armature, showing high reduction and separation of sound details.\u00a0</p>\n<p style=\"\"><img alt=\"S1-S1D\u8be6\u60c5\u66f4\u6539\u82f1_05\" src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/H576816e40bcb4ef6bacdb6194897f9dd4.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>\n<p>5.0 Bluetooth chip supports the new generation of low latency game mode</p>\n<div>\u00a0When\u00a0you\u00a0are\u00a0ready\u00a0to\u00a0enter\u00a0the\u00a0game,\u00a0tap\u00a0three\u00a0times\u00a0in\u00a0a\u00a0row\u00a0to\u00a0start\u00a0the\u00a0low\u00a0delay\u00a0game\u00a0mode.\u00a0</div>\n<div>\u00a0</div>\n<div>Compared with the normal mode, the low delay mode of the game has faster transmission speed of sound signal and more shocking game experience.</div>\n<div><p><span style=\"color: rgb(247, 150, 70);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong>Only the KZ-S1 supports the game mode.</strong></span></span></p></div>\n<p style=\"\"><img alt=\"S1-S1D\u8be6\u60c5\u66f4\u6539\u82f1_06\" src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/H9c8b644511ef45a1a31b09b4ff83df2fP.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>\n<p style=\"\"><img alt=\"S1-S1D\u8be6\u60c5\u66f4\u6539\u82f1_07\" src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/H4fd2d093e24043eeb924740b6e0e5f69w.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>\n<p>Different from traditional TWS headset design</p>\n<p>Focus on improving visual appeal and wearing comfort</p>\n<p>The ergonomically designed smooth outer cavity lines, metal sounding mouth and colorful matching resin complement each other, giving this unique wireless Bluetooth headset a new cool beauty.</p>\n<p style=\"\"><img alt=\"S1-S1D\u8be6\u60c5\u66f4\u6539\u82f1_08\" src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/Hbe07d1d1bb174321825f80cfdf175b2dt.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"><img alt=\"S1-S1D\u8be6\u60c5\u66f4\u6539\u82f1_09\" src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/Hc3956feeb10d43b095ceab82a39303ffs.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>\n<p>One touch control\u00a0</p>\n<p>Everything is simple from pairing to operating. Just move your fingers, you can easily achieve a variety of needs.</p>\n<p>Play / Pause:<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Touch lightly\u00a0</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Previous song / next\u00a0song:</span><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Double click the left headset / double click the right headset</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Start Siri:</span><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Long press for 2 seconds</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Answer/hang up:</span><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Touch lightly\u00a0</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Refuse to answer the call:</span><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Long press for calling</span></p>\n<p style=\"\"><img alt=\"S1-S1D\u8be6\u60c5\u66f4\u6539\u82f1_10\" src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/H12e3de24cd5744aeaa931487e804ddabp.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"><img alt=\"S1-S1D\u8be6\u60c5\u66f4\u6539\u82f1_11\" src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/Haf13ab4a93964683bebb7a2b8a772afdw.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>\n<p><strong>Product specifications:</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(247, 150, 70);\"><strong>Bluetooth version :V5.0</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(247, 150, 70);\"><strong>Bluetooth Range : about 20m</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(247, 150, 70);\"><strong>Headset battery capacity:40mA</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(247, 150, 70);\"><strong>Battery capacity of charging compartment : 300mA</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(247, 150, 70);\"><strong>Headset operation time : \u2248 3H</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(247, 150, 70);\"><strong>Standby time of charging compartment : \u2265 100h</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(247, 150, 70);\"><strong>Headset weight :10g</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(247, 150, 70);\"><strong>Charging compartment weight :45g</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"\"><img alt=\"S1-S1D\u8be6\u60c5\u66f4\u6539\u82f1_12\" src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/H1c6d23677f3e4295bb585f499ec45ed4N.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>\n<p><strong>common problems:</strong></p>\n<p><strong>If you encounter any problems during use, please consult online customer service in time. We will serve you to your satisfaction.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>1.<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Why is the left and right headset switching unsuccessful?</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(192, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Answer:\u00a0When the headset is connected to the phone for the first time, the pairing prompt that pops up must be clicked, otherwise the left and right ears cannot be switched freely.</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">2.</span><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">When using both ears, only one ear has sound?</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(192, 0, 0); font-size: 13.3333px;\">Answer:</span><span style=\"color: rgb(192, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">The reason is that the paired headsets are not paired successfully. It is recommended to delete the Bluetooth pairing information and reconnect.</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">3.\u00a0</span><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">headset disconnected?\u00a0</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(192, 0, 0); font-size: 13.3333px;\">Answer</span><span style=\"color: rgb(192, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">:</span><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">The headset will be disconnected when it is out of the valid range of the device,and return to Bluetooth range within 3 minutes it will automatically reconnect</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">4.</span><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Failed to pair with computer?</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(192, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Answer:</span><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Please confirm whether the computer has Bluetooth function. If not, you can assemble a Bluetooth adapter with USB interface</span></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"\"><img alt=\"S1-S1D\u8be6\u60c5\u66f4\u6539\u82f1_13\" src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/Hc0c4918ea14e41caae7ff01a7d84eb928.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">\u00a0</p>\n</div></div>",
